## 📖 Create Booklet Easy for Mac

**Create Booklet** is a PDF publishing and imposition utility designed to turn standard PDF documents into properly arranged, printable booklets. It automatically reorganizes pages so that when printed, folded, and bound, the document reads in the correct order.

It is useful for creating **mini-books, manuals, brochures, newsletters, programs, and other folded PDF publications** directly from a Mac.

<div align="left">

> 📄 **PDF Imposition:** Automatically rearrange PDF pages into booklet-printing order.
> 🖨️ **Booklet Printing:** Prepare documents for folded and bound paper output.
> 🔄 **Duplex Support:** Work with automatic two-sided printers.
> 🔃 **Manual Flip:** Support workflows for printers without automatic duplex printing.
> 📐 **Custom Layouts:** Adjust paper size, margins, alignment, and scaling.
> 📏 **Creep Compensation:** Compensate for page movement in thicker booklets.
> 👀 **Print Preview:** Review the arranged document before printing.
> 📤 **PDF Export:** Save the imposed booklet as a new ready-to-print PDF.


## 📄 Automatic PDF Page Imposition

The main purpose of Create Booklet is to handle the page-ordering work that is normally difficult to arrange manually. The application prepares the PDF so that printed sheets can be folded into the intended reading sequence.

<div align="left">

> 🔢 **Automatic Ordering:** Arrange pages into the correct booklet sequence automatically.
> 📑 **Page Pairing:** Position pages appropriately for folded-sheet printing.
> 📖 **Reading Order:** Keep the final folded booklet in normal page sequence.
> 🧩 **Imposition:** Convert a conventional PDF page sequence into a print-ready arrangement.
> ⚡ **Fast Processing:** Process standard PDF documents without manually rearranging every page.
> 👀 **Preview:** Check the resulting layout before sending it to the printer.
> 🛠️ **Publishing Workflow:** Prepare PDFs for brochures, manuals, programs, and mini-books.

</div>

## 🖨️ Duplex & Manual Flip Printing

Create Booklet supports both automatic duplex printers and manual two-pass printing workflows.

<div align="left">

> 🔄 **Automatic Duplex:** Use compatible printers that can print on both sides automatically.
> 🖨️ **Two-Sided Output:** Arrange the imposed pages for front-and-back printing.
> 🔃 **Manual Flip:** Use a printer that requires the paper stack to be turned over between passes.
> 📄 **Odd Pages:** Print the first side of the booklet when using a manual workflow.
> 🔁 **Even Pages:** Reload or flip the printed stack for the second side.
> 📋 **Printing Instructions:** Follow the application's workflow for manual two-sided printing.
> 📖 **Final Folding:** Fold the printed sheets through the center and staple or bind them.

</div>

