## 📏 Creep Compensation for Thick Booklets

When many sheets are folded together, inner pages can extend farther outward than the outer pages. Create Booklet includes **creep compensation** to help account for this effect.

<div align="left">

> 📚 **Thick Booklets:** Handle page movement that becomes more noticeable with larger page counts.
> 📏 **Creep Adjustment:** Compensate for the gradual shift of inner pages.
> ✂️ **Trimming:** Help prepare the booklet for cleaner edge trimming.
> 📐 **Binding Margins:** Configure additional space where binding requires it.
> 🧩 **Page Positioning:** Refine the layout for folded and bound publications.
> 🖨️ **Print Preparation:** Adjust the layout before producing the physical booklet.
> 🎯 **Fine Control:** Make booklet output more suitable for professional-looking results.


