## 🛠️ How to Create a PDF Booklet

<div align="left">

> 1️⃣ **Add PDF:** 📄 Drag and drop your PDF into Create Booklet.
> 2️⃣ **Choose Paper:** 📐 Select A4, Letter, or another required paper size.
> 3️⃣ **Set Margins:** 📏 Configure margins and layout settings.
> 4️⃣ **Check Preview:** 👀 Review the imposed page sequence before printing.
> 5️⃣ **Select Duplex:** 🔄 Enable two-sided printing when supported by the printer.
> 6️⃣ **Manual Flip:** 🔃 Use the application's two-pass workflow when automatic duplex is unavailable.
> 7️⃣ **Print or Export:** 🖨️ Print the booklet or 📤 save the imposed layout as a new PDF.
> 8️⃣ **Fold & Bind:** 📖 Fold the printed sheets through the center and staple or bind them.

