## ⚙️ Create Booklet Printing Tips

<div align="left">

> 🖨️ **Check Printer:** Confirm whether your printer supports automatic duplex printing.
> 📄 **Use Correct Paper:** Select the same paper dimensions configured inside the application.
> 👀 **Preview First:** Always inspect the imposed page order before a large print run.
> 📏 **Check Margins:** Leave enough space for folding and binding.
> 📚 **Use Creep:** Enable appropriate creep compensation for thicker booklets.
> 🔃 **Manual Duplex:** Follow the correct paper-flipping direction when using a single-sided printer.
> ✂️ **Trim Carefully:** Allow sufficient margin when final booklet edges need trimming.
> 💾 **Export Backup:** Save the imposed PDF when you expect to print the same booklet again.

