## ❓ Create Booklet for Mac – FAQ

<div align="left">

### ❔ What is Create Booklet?

📖 Create Booklet is a PDF imposition and publishing utility that rearranges standard PDF pages into a format suitable for printing, folding, and binding as a booklet.

### ❔ Can Create Booklet automatically arrange PDF pages?

🔢 Yes. Its automatic page-imposition feature rearranges pages into the appropriate booklet sequence.

### ❔ Does it support duplex printing?

🔄 Yes. Create Booklet supports workflows for automatic two-sided printing as well as manual paper flipping.

### ❔ Can I use a normal single-sided printer?

🖨️ Yes. The listed workflow supports printing one side first and then flipping the paper stack for the second pass.

### ❔ Does Create Booklet support custom margins?

📏 Yes. Custom margins, alignment, paper sizes, and binding-related adjustments are supported.

### ❔ What is creep compensation?

📚 Creep compensation adjusts the layout to account for inner pages shifting outward in thicker folded booklets.

### ❔ Can I export a booklet PDF instead of printing directly?

📤 Yes. The imposed booklet layout can be exported as a new PDF file.

### ❔ Does Create Booklet support Apple Silicon Macs?

🍎 Yes. The listed requirements include Intel and Apple Silicon processors, including M1, M2, and M3.

### ❔ What macOS version is required?

💻 The listed minimum requirement is **macOS 10.15 Catalina or later**.

### ❔ What files can Create Booklet process?

📄 The listed file support is for standard PDF documents.

